id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
42717::$$$message_0348_0000_0000$$$::"Sakura, this correspondence came for you."::
42718::$$$message_0348_0000_0001$$$::"Um... 'To the participants of the Holy Grail War,[lr]::
42719::$$$message_0348_0000_0002$$$::welcome to the Holy Grail bath'...?"::
42720::$$$message_0348_0000_0003$$$::"Yes. Apparently, it is in a place only Servants can reach, and the first to enter will find happiness."::
42721::$$$message_0348_0000_0004$$$::"Where'd you get this?"::
42722::$$$message_0348_0000_0005$$$::"Lancer left it with me. I think he was running errands for Kirei Kotomine."::
42723::$$$message_0348_0000_0006$$$::"Father Kotomine works him really hard, doesn't he?"::
42724::$$$message_0348_0000_0007$$$::"As a fellow Servant, I can sympathize. What will you do, Sakura?"::
42725::$$$message_0348_0000_0008$$$::"Hmm... If I can be happy...I think I'd like to go."::
42726::$$$message_0348_0000_0009$$$::"Very well. Then let us be off.[lr]::
42727::$$$message_0348_0000_0010$$$::I'll do everything to see you win."µfVU